    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d161">

                <pb facs="0256" n="209" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg209"/>

                <head>161. Telegram 682 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d161-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-09-03">September 3, 1955, 6:46
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d161-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d161-1"/>
                <p>682. For Johnson.</p>
                <p>Reur 672. In light very cogent reasons set forth reftel we concur QTE agreed
                    announcement UNQTE should be released by you and Wang accordance paragraph 6
                    Deptel 391.</p>
                <pb facs="0257" n="210" type="typeset" xml:id="pg210"/>
                <p>We also concur tactics for Friday’s meeting suggested reftel but would hope Dept
                    could be informed immediately announcement made Geneva thus enabling public
                    relations aspect be taken care of in Washington and possibly Denver almost
                    simultaneously with Geneva announcement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Hoover</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
